{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine-2609-0065","content_id":"0990d86c-162c-43a5-b71f-1e621b8f08f4","description":"Product Recall for  Love to Dream Sleep Machine presenting a risk of fire.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e30561af-b376-47f2-aafa-a4f9b53f8db9","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:27:36+01:00","id":"e30561af-b376-47f2-aafa-a4f9b53f8db9","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-09-10T12:27:36+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa294289f95f408139c65fe/2609-0065-product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Love to Dream Sleep Machine</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire because the lithium-ion battery in the product may overheat during charging/</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by the manufacturer Love to Dream and the following retailers: Boots, Harrods, and John Lewis and Partners.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby Safety Monitoring (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Love to Dream</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>LTD-SM23</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected date codes</td>\n      <td>7T12TN, 7W15TN and 8P01TN</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>2 January 2025 to 3 September 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A portable white noise sound machine with night light. The date code is on the side of the Sleep Machine, or on the back of the box. No other date code is currently included in the recall.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e30561af-b376-47f2-aafa-a4f9b53f8db9\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa294289f95f408139c65fe/2609-0065-product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire because the lithium-ion battery in the product may overheat during charging, which could pose a fire hazard to consumers.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by the manufacturer Love to Dream and the following retailers: Boots, Harrods, and John Lewis and Partners.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers should stop using the product immediately. For more information on disposal instructions and claiming a refund or replacement, contact Love to Dream on  recall@lovetodream.com or visit the specific websites below:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://lovetodream.co.uk/pages/sleep-machine-safety-recall-2026\">Love to Dream UK</a></li>\n  <li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.boots.com/product-recall\">Boots</a></li>\n  <li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.harrods.com/en-gb/c/product-recalls?srsltid=AfmBOoruxdGAfIaKLc9AV8O9ao2VXB2Tm2TUIb0FxfW4dbklAjFD78aL\">Harrods UK</a></li>\n  <li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.johnlewis.com/customer-services/shopping-with-us/product-recalls\">John Lewis &amp; Partners</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0065</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-10T12:53:35Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-10","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-10T13:53:36+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine-2609-0065","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine-2609-0065","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine-2609-0065","content_id":"0990d86c-162c-43a5-b71f-1e621b8f08f4","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-10T12:53:36Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Love to Dream Sleep Machine (2609-0065)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-love-to-dream-sleep-machine-2609-0065","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":